@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `homecare-nouns`
IMPORT `homecare-definitions`

-- Liberty HomeCare (UW-RPP-W-001-06-V): the definition of the Insured Perils (Rủi Ro Được
-- Bảo Hiểm), Perils 1-9 with the exclusions and conditions each carries. Part 1 is limited to
-- loss "caused by an Insured Peril" (src:296); Part 3 uses the same test.
-- Quotations (`src:N`) are line N of ../../source/raw/liberty-homecare.txt.
--
-- SHAPE. `the grounds under the Insured Perils that defeat` a loss is the list of reasons,
-- in source order, why the cause is not an Insured Peril or is excluded within one. An empty
-- list means the loss was caused by an Insured Peril and no exclusion inside that Peril
-- applies. Part 1's own exclusions and the General Exclusions are applied elsewhere.
--
-- src:163 | Rủi Ro Được Bảo Hiểm
-- src:164 | Là các rủi ro được liệt kê cụ thể sau đây được bảo hiểm trong Phần I – Thiệt Hại Vật Chất theo các
-- src:165 | điều khoản và điều kiện của Hợp Đồng Bảo Hiểm:

§ `The Insured Perils`

§§ `The grounds`

DECLARE `A ground under the Insured Perils` IS ONE OF
    `the cause is not one of the nine Insured Perils`
    `Peril 1(a): fermentation, natural heating or spontaneous combustion`
    `Peril 1(b): a process involving heat`
    `Peril 1(c): burning by order of a public authority`
    `Peril 1(d): forest, bush or grass fire, or clearing land by fire`
    `Peril 1(e): scorching, melting or charring without flame`
    `Peril 2: a boiler or other pressure vessel or apparatus, or its contents`
    `Peril 3: power fluctuation, without evidence of lightning`
    `Peril 4(e): the act furthered a riot or strike or resisted a lockout`
    `Peril 4(i)(a): terrorism`
    `Peril 4(i)(b): civil commotion amounting to a popular rising`
    `Peril 4(i)(c): wilful corruption of computer information`
    `Peril 4(ii)(a): consequential or indirect loss`
    `Peril 4(ii)(b): cessation of work or interruption of a process`
    `Peril 4(ii)(c): confiscation, commandeering or requisition`
    `Peril 4(ii)(d): unlawful occupation of the Home`
    `Peril 4(iii)(a): intentional act of the Insured, the Family or their guests`
    `Peril 4(iii)(b): intentional act of tenants, guests or their families`
    `Peril 5(a): frost or hail`
    `Peril 5(b): subsidence or landslip not caused by earthquake or volcano`
    `Peril 5(c): a retaining wall, garden wall, gate or fence`
    `Peril 5(d): an awning, sign or external fixture, or movable property in the open`
    `Peril 5(e): trees, shrubs or plants`
    `Peril 5(f): premises under construction, not complete and storm-proof`
    `Peril 5(g): water or rain`
    `Peril 5(h): escape of water from a tank, apparatus or pipe`
    `Peril 5(i): atmospheric or climatic conditions`
    `Peril 6(a): leakage from an automatic sprinkler system`
    `Peril 6(b): the Home was vacant or unoccupied`
    `Peril 6(c): the loss occurred gradually`
    `Peril 7: the leakage was not sudden`
    `Peril 7(a): repairs or alterations`
    `Peril 7(b): the sprinkler system was under repair, removal or extension`
    `Peril 7(c): freezing while vacant or through the Insured's neglect`
    `Peril 7(d): an order of government or other authority`
    `Peril 7(e): construction defects or conditions known beforehand`
    `Peril 9: the Home is not enclosed by walls or fences`
    `Peril 9: no force or violence to enter or leave`
    `Peril 9(a): by deception`
    `Peril 9(b): by a person lawfully on the premises or by connivance`
    `Peril 9(c): from a part of the Home lent, let or sublet`
    `Peril 9(d): the Home unattended for more than 30 consecutive days`
    `Peril 9(e): property already damaged or incomplete`
    `Peril 9(f): property in a part other tenants can enter without force`
    `Peril 9(g): property in the open outside the Home`
    `Peril 9(h): property in transit`

-- A loss "falls between" nothing: every cause is either one of the nine or it is not.
@ref Definitions, Rủi Ro Được Bảo Hiểm, src:163-283
GIVEN loss     IS A `A Part 1 loss`
      premises IS A `The insured premises`
GIVETH A LIST OF `A ground under the Insured Perils`
`the grounds under the Insured Perils that defeat` loss `, at` premises MEANS
    CONSIDER loss's `the cause`
    WHEN `fire`                                           THEN `Peril 1, fire` loss
    WHEN `explosion`                                      THEN `Peril 2, explosion` loss
    WHEN `lightning`                                      THEN `Peril 3, lightning` loss
    WHEN `riot or civil disturbance`                      THEN `Peril 4, riot, strike and malicious act` loss
    WHEN `lawful authority suppressing a disturbance`     THEN `Peril 4, riot, strike and malicious act` loss
    WHEN `wilful act of a striker or locked-out worker`   THEN `Peril 4, riot, strike and malicious act` loss
    WHEN `lawful authority suppressing a striker's act`   THEN `Peril 4, riot, strike and malicious act` loss
    WHEN `malicious act of any person`                    THEN `Peril 4, riot, strike and malicious act` loss
    WHEN `earthquake`                                     THEN `Peril 5, earthquake, volcano, storm and flood` loss
    WHEN `volcanic eruption`                              THEN `Peril 5, earthquake, volcano, storm and flood` loss
    WHEN `storm`                                          THEN `Peril 5, earthquake, volcano, storm and flood` loss
    WHEN `whirlwind`                                      THEN `Peril 5, earthquake, volcano, storm and flood` loss
    WHEN `typhoon`                                        THEN `Peril 5, earthquake, volcano, storm and flood` loss
    WHEN `flood`                                          THEN `Peril 5, earthquake, volcano, storm and flood` loss
    WHEN `escape of water from a tank, apparatus or pipe` THEN `Peril 6, escape of water` loss
    WHEN `sprinkler leakage`                              THEN `Peril 7, sprinkler leakage` loss
    WHEN `impact by aircraft or articles dropped from it` THEN EMPTY
    WHEN `impact by a vehicle or animal`                  THEN EMPTY
    WHEN `theft or attempted theft`                       THEN `Peril 9, theft` premises loss
    WHEN `seaquake, tidal wave or hail`                   THEN LIST `the cause is not one of the nine Insured Perils`
    WHEN `another cause`                                  THEN LIST `the cause is not one of the nine Insured Perils`

@ref Definitions, Rủi Ro Được Bảo Hiểm, src:163-283
GIVEN loss     IS A `A Part 1 loss`
      premises IS A `The insured premises`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the loss was caused by an Insured Peril, not excluded within it` loss `, at` premises MEANS
    null (`the grounds under the Insured Perils that defeat` loss `, at` premises)

§§ `Peril 1: fire`

-- Fire (whether from explosion or otherwise, including subterranean fire), excluding loss
-- (a) by fermentation, natural heating or spontaneous combustion; (b) by undergoing any
-- process involving heat; (c) by order of any public authority; (d) from forest, bush,
-- prairie, pampas or jungle fire, accidental or not, or clearing land by fire; (e) to anything
-- by scorching, melting or charring without flame.
-- src:166 | 1. Cháy (dù do sự cố nổ hoặc nguyên nhân khác bao gồm cháy ngầm dưới mặt đất) nhưng loại trừ
-- src:167 | trường hợp tổn thất hoặc thiệt hại:
-- src:168 | (a) do quá trình lên men, tăng nhiệt tự nhiên hoặc tự bốc cháy;
-- src:169 | (b) do phải trải qua bất kỳ quy trình nào liên quan đến việc sử dụng nhiệt;
-- src:170 | (c) theo lệnh của bất kỳ cấp chính quyền nào;
-- src:171 | (d) gây ra bởi hoặc phát sinh từ hoặc do hậu quả của việc cháy, tình cờ hay không tình cờ của
-- src:172 | rừng, bụi rậm, đồng cỏ, đồng hoa hoặc rừng nhiệt đới, và việc khai hoang đất bằng lửa;
-- src:173 | (e) xảy ra với bất kỳ vật gì do cháy sém, nóng chảy hoặc đốt thành than mà không có ngọn lửa.
@ref Insured Peril 1, src:166-173
GIVEN loss IS A `A Part 1 loss`
GIVETH A LIST OF `A ground under the Insured Perils`
`Peril 1, fire` loss MEANS
    `those that hold among`
        (LIST PAIR `Peril 1(a): fermentation, natural heating or spontaneous combustion` (`it was` `fermentation, natural heating or spontaneous combustion`)
            , PAIR `Peril 1(b): a process involving heat`                                (`it was` `the property underwent a process involving heat`)
            , PAIR `Peril 1(c): burning by order of a public authority`                  (`it was` `burning by order of a public authority`)
            , PAIR `Peril 1(d): forest, bush or grass fire, or clearing land by fire`     (`it was` `forest, bush, grass or jungle fire, or clearing land by fire`)
            , PAIR `Peril 1(e): scorching, melting or charring without flame`            (`it was` `scorching, melting or charring without flame`))
    WHERE
        `it was` c MEANS elem c (loss's `the circumstances`)

§§ `Peril 2: explosion`

-- Explosion, excluding loss to boilers, economisers or other vessels, machinery or apparatus
-- in which pressure is used, or their contents, when an explosion occurs.
-- src:174 | 2. Nổ nhưng loại trừ trường hợp tổn thất, phá hủy hoặc thiệt hại đối với nồi hơi, bộ phận tiết kiệm
-- src:175 | năng lượng hoặc các bình chứa khác, các máy móc hoặc thiết bị sử dụng áp suất hoặc những vật
-- src:176 | chứa bên trong khi xảy ra sự cố nổ.
@ref Insured Peril 2, src:174-176
GIVEN loss IS A `A Part 1 loss`
GIVETH A LIST OF `A ground under the Insured Perils`
`Peril 2, explosion` loss MEANS
    `those that hold among`
        (LIST PAIR `Peril 2: a boiler or other pressure vessel or apparatus, or its contents`
                   (elem `a boiler, economiser or other pressure vessel or apparatus, or its contents` (loss's `the property`)))

§§ `Peril 3: lightning`

-- Lightning, excluding loss from fluctuation of the electricity supply, unless there is
-- evidence that the damage was caused by lightning.
-- src:177 | 3. Sét đánh nhưng loại trừ trường hợp tổn thất, phá hủy hoặc thiệt hại gây ra từ sự dao động nguồn
-- src:178 | điện, trừ khi có bằng chứng chứng minh rằng sự thiệt hại đó do sét đánh.
@ref Insured Peril 3, src:177-178
GIVEN loss IS A `A Part 1 loss`
GIVETH A LIST OF `A ground under the Insured Perils`
`Peril 3, lightning` loss MEANS
    `those that hold among`
        (LIST PAIR `Peril 3: power fluctuation, without evidence of lightning`
                   (    `it was` `fluctuation of the electricity supply`
                    AND NOT `it was` `evidence shows the damage was caused by lightning`))
    WHERE
        `it was` c MEANS elem c (loss's `the circumstances`)

§§ `Peril 4: riot, strike, locked-out workers, malicious act`

-- Direct loss caused by (a) a person taking part with others in a disturbance of the public
-- peace; (b) lawful authority suppressing it; (c) the wilful act of a striker or locked-out
-- worker in furtherance of a strike or resisting a lockout; (d) lawful authority suppressing
-- such an act; (e) the malicious act of any person, but not an act intended to further a riot
-- or strike or to resist a lockout (those are limbs (a) and (c)).
-- src:179 | 4. Bạo động, Đình công, Công nhân Bế xưởng, Hành động Ác ý của bất kỳ một người nào.
